                "source_case_id": "mediadive.ingredient:1722",
                "assessment": "KAl(SO4)2 source1722 CAS10043-67-1 agrees with anhydrous potassium aluminium sulfate CHEBI86463. The current Alk_So42 owner represents that substance, distinct from twelve-water alum. Two active owner tokens, Na SiO .9H O and ZnSO .7H O, contain different elements and are not names of this K/Al sulfate; they require source-preserving rejection in the coordinated shared owner proposal. This source case does not authorize complete owner release."
              }
            ]
