        "identity": "Actual CHEBI86158 defines calcium chloride dihydrate with two waters and CAS10035-04-8; CCAP TAP and TOGOM520 support the supplied-form source spellings. Full row remains held for inherited preparation/concentration aliases: the literal stock solution and solution tokens clearly denote preparations, while bare0.1%w/v and5M require original context to distinguish stock strength from receiving dose. The0.1%w/v basis is already explicit. No assertion that four complete stock recipes were recovered.",
