        "identity": "Actual31345D-calcium-pantothenate structure/CAS137-08-6, Sigma hemicalcium formula and D-specific name, JCM558 D-calcium, DSMZ1266 hemicalcium andTOGO1666/1667 literalpanthothenate establish named salt. MediaDive1123 has formula typo extraH relative to charge-balanced supplier/ChEBI; do not copy it. DL andcapsaicin labels are rejected correctly. P5 currentcapture is metadata-only; frozenP5solute alias is chemical-compatible but its occurrence/source release remains held.",
