          "All15tokens preserve calcium salt; hemicalcium is half-Ca per pantothenate unit, consistent with2:1 completeformula, not half a molecularhydrate. Spelling variants retain D where stated; generic names are documentedterm synonyms, not automaticDLsource assignment. P5B5 raw name denotes solute, not whole stock."
