            "locator": "Complete source recipe/product table and preparation; inspect the exact source label and context named in each case applicability",
            "supports_or_contradicts": "case2: Hemicalcium D-(+)-pantothenate denotes one-half calcium equivalent per D-pantothenate unit, the same 2:1 D-pantothenate calcium salt represented by CHEBI31345. Official supplier and MediaDive ingredient1123 agree on CAS137-08-6. This supports the raw D-specific alias, but cannot support DL aliases presently on the owner. Four capsaicin names also belong to CHEBI3374 and must be excluded from pantothenate identity matching.",
