        {
          "evidence_id": "A-E-EXTRA-001",
          "entry": {
            "evidence_id": "A-E-EXTRA-001",
            "kind": "ontology",
            "capture": {
              "root": "artifact",
              "path": "research-a/captures/cf445cba86db1200.raw",
              "sha256": "d2a04309eb6976fd395f9684ec4c3f5192362e2b6b75464b0af128a28e188d25"
            },
            "locator": "OLS term label, is_obsolete, synonyms, chemical annotations and source xrefs",
            "supports_or_contradicts": "case2: Hemicalcium D-(+)-pantothenate denotes one-half calcium equivalent per D-pantothenate unit, the same 2:1 D-pantothenate calcium salt represented by CHEBI31345. Official supplier and MediaDive ingredient1123 agree on CAS137-08-6. This supports the raw D-specific alias, but cannot support DL aliases presently on the owner. Four capsaicin names also belong to CHEBI3374 and must be excluded from pantothenate identity matching.; case5: The doubled hyphen is punctuation, but DL is a stereochemical boundary. Sixteen available JCM primary recipes explicitly name DL-Calcium pantothenate. CHEBI180950 is current, nonobsolete Calcium DL-pantothenate, distinct from D-specific CHEBI31345. Its structure lacks stereochemical specification and its CAS cross-reference differs from a supplier DL SDS; no CAS or formula enrichment is inferred from that conflict.; case16: JCM558 names D-Calcium pantothenate in its seven-vitamin mixture. This agrees with D-specific CHEBI31345 and the salt stoichiometry corroborated by supplier hemicalcium nomenclature. The doubled hyphen is a harmless raw spelling, unlike a DL qualifier.; case32: The frozen TOGOM3129 label explicitly says DL-Ca-pantothenate, and current CHEBI180950 provides a distinct DL target. The exact Togo primary recipe endpoint timed out and no original source link is present. Another DL occurrence elsewhere in this shard family has a live D-only recipe conflict, so the frozen label must not be promoted on a family-wide assumption.",
            "url": "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/api/ontologies/chebi/terms?iri=http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_31345",
            "case_ids": [
              "CM_NAME:012330c5320a4968ed592d7a76fff13d4dcad09a07528cf53127908aa4a08938",
              "CM_NAME:059a93d33a57f51788fe5cf8de33a803d555df73119e6b9bdaa15e430969f59f",
              "CM_NAME:11e4479bd0ecc400516731fbfcc48ebb29a1be6b76404f62c27481856b1059cc",
              "CM_NAME:2825b13cac1d4958ca31908cb0d6be31c6480344a51bdbbc7c245547cc2f3779"
            ],
            "accessed_at": "2026-11-08T05:08:09.391939+00:00"
          },
