        "identity": "JCM54/55 and TOGO46/47 explicitly use peeled/cut carrot food tissue before extraction. Existing NCIT26.02d cache gives C72000 Carrot, semantic type Food and Vegetable C178192 parent whose definition includes plants OR parts cultivated for food. This resolves the plant-versus-food gap without asserting whole-plant identity or derived-extract equivalence. No aliases emit. Cache acquisition receipt is unauthenticated; exact existing DB hash/version and read-only extraction are bound.",
