        "identity": "TOGO1331 literal Meat peptone (BD Bacto)5g supports source qualification on the generic meat-peptone owner; its enriched Bacto Peptone display label is not exact catalogue/product equivalence. The existing full MICRO0000176 OWL stanza, independently read by /root/skeptical_review and now read by /root, defines enzymatic hydrolysis of meat/muscle proteins from mammalian sources; its BD definition-source quotation discusses muscle/offal/gelatin and variable enzymes. This supports the ordinary enzymatic meat-peptone material sense, without asserting a purchased lot has a particular mixed-species ratio or requiring an unstated SKU. Bacto_Peptone comparison owner remains separate. No aliases emit.",
