        "identity": "Actual6636 is2Cl.Mg/CAS7786-30-3 with MgCl2, bracketedformula and Magnesiumchlorid names; DSMZ514 explicitly weighs anhydrous5.90g. Four emitted names preserve water-free salt and no hydrate/product assertion. DSMZ514a references half-strength514; it is not independent hydrate specification.",
