        "recommendation": "WITHHOLD_WHOLE_ROW_INHERITED_ALIAS_SCOPE",
        "identity": "Actual31795 is seven-water Mg sulfate/CAS10034-99-8. CCAP E27/E31/E31ANT show MgSO4.7H20 and TAP MgSO4.7H2O, supporting the two new flattened source aliases with exact source attribution. NBRC406 itself prints MgSO2·7H2O and TOGO enriches it; current rejection is preserved rather than inventing correction. Inherited hydration-unspecified aliases remain unresolved as documented; several older flattened kg_microbe/backfill strings still require their own source restoration and are not newly approved merely because a similar new CCAP spelling is verified. Full row withheld, explicit seven-water names supported.",
