        "recommendation": "SUPPORT_CONDITIONAL_CANONICAL_ROW",
        "identity": "Actual506227 is D-configured free monomer C8H15NO6 with anomer unspecified/CAS7512-17-6 and all systematic/GlcNAc/chitosamine names. Actual8006 is peptidoglycan polymer/residue C34H60N8O18 and must not replace monomer. JCM1429 explicitly doses spaced N-Acetyl-D-glucosamine1g in separately added stock; preserve source nesting rather than call entire stock monomer. Eight emitted names retain D specificity, doubled-dash typography and supplier qualifier without new grade or fixed alpha/beta assignment. Historical JCM201 retrieval gap remains, no LB-context substitution.",
