        "identity": "Actual32142 isC6H5O7.2H2O.3Na/CAS6132-04-3. JCM704/1331 give2.94g and JCM1492 gives1.0g;TOGO3175explicittribasicdihydrate supports new water-qualified names. Existing Na2citrate labels specify two sodium and0.6g/L stock describes preparation, unlike canonical trisodium dihydrate. Original generic/backfill dehydrate wording also lacks a demonstrated historic form/typographic bridge in cited sources. Retain exact canonical names while withholding those whole-row token claims.",
