          "publication_obligations": "The rumen-fluid component is retained at the literal source-label scope as rumen fluid, UNMAPPED, with no component identifier. The recovered MicrobeDecoder observation does not specify clarification, animal species, or a preparation protocol. The full cited publication was not retrieved in this review; the captured access failures cannot establish a protocol. This is unresolved processing, not evidence that the fluid was untreated. The former redirect to kgmicrobe.ingredient:clarified_rumen_fluid is withdrawn under https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1204#issuecomment-6718503591 and https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1237. Unrelated component identities, concentrations, whole-mixture identity and source holds are unchanged. Inherited mapping-evidence objects and research evidence remain historical provenance; their clarification claims and historical all-components-identified counts do not describe this successor. The prior 2026-11-08 dependency-only redirect event is preserved as superseded history. No generic UBERON grounding, recipe equivalence, animal-origin claim or downstream approval is added. Original W05 source-case and cross-shard ownership boundaries remain unchanged; this does not add the underlying MicrobeDecoder observations to W05 source ownership."
        }
