        "identity": "Generic poly(3-hydroxybutyrate) CHEBI53389 is repeat-unit polymer without imposedR stereochemistry. DSMZ474 explicitly adds3g poly-beta-hydroxybutyric acid in100mLwater with sonication/autoclave. Ingredient is not that whole suspension or monomer; do not collapse stereospecific131525.",
